          "type": "unordered-list",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "seo_and_content_management",
            "highlight_notes_list": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Task and Resource Management",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "task_and_resource_management",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Need prioritize tasks, optimize resource allocation. Discussions on managing bandwidth effectively, especially with team members traveling or unavailable.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "fab54a2f-b66b-4032-aedc-a730585b196e",
                    "time": 494.8,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Delays in tasks like Super K backward plan, need for better prioritization. Tasks are being postponed due to resource constraints.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "73aebd86-24b2-4fe3-a464-59446f3eb28a",
                    "time": 2638.425,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Use timesheets for tracking, optimizing resource allocation. Assign priorities using priority columns (P0, P1, P2) to ensure focus on critical tasks. Encourage team members to seek help for small tasks to minimize delays.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "4fce16b5-04ba-4616-a511-e8e61d552f2a",
